, "label": "torch_compile_args", "type": "SEEDVR2_TORCH_COMPILE", "localized_name": "torch_compile_args"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "device"}, "name": "device", "label": "device", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "device"}, {"widget": {"name": "blocks_to_swap"}, "shape": 7, "name": "blocks_to_swap", "label": "blocks_to_swap", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "blocks_to_swap"}, {"widget": {"name": "swap_io_components"}, "shape": 7, "name": "swap_io_components", "label": "swap_io_components", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "swap_io_components"}, {"widget": {"name": "offload_device"}, "shape": 7, "name": "offload_device", "label": "offload_device", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "offload_device"}, {"widget": {"name": "attention_mode"}, "shape": 7, "name": "attention_mode", "label": "attention_mode", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "attention_mode"}], "flags": {}, "id": 14, "type": "SeedVR2LoadDiTModel", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SeedVR2LoadDiTModel"}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [459.6915588378906, 386.6026306152344], "pos": [1516.56396484375, 1826.737060546875], "widgets_values": ["## ⭐blocks to swap:\n### 是显存优化节点，意思是：要交换到GPU显存的 Transformer 块数量。用时间换取空间，如果跳出显存不够就把“要交换的块”拉高。范围通常 0–40，选择3B模型设为32,7B模型设为36\n## ⭐SeedVR2 模型核心区别（极简版）\n### 这些模型主要在参数量（3B/7B）、精度 / 量化格式、是否带 sharp 增强三个维度区分：\n### 1. 参数量：3B vs 7B\n#### 3B：体积小、显存占用低、速度更快，适合日常 / 轻度高清修复，8–12G 显存可跑。\n#### 7B：参数量更大，细节 / 画质更强，适合专业修复，需要 16G+ 显存（配合 blocks_to_swap 可降低要求）。⭐7b Q4 K-M适合放大4K的不适合放大2k的小图，所以小图用3B的就可以\n### 2. 精度 / 量化格式\n#### FP16：原生半精度，画质最好、无 artifacts，显存占用最高，稳定性最佳。\n#### FP8（如 fp8_e4m3fn）：精度略降，显存省 40–50%，速度更快，可能出现轻微条纹瑕疵。\n#### GGUF（如 Q4_K_M/Q8_0）：量化压缩版，显存占用最低（比 FP16 省 60–75%），画质有轻微损失，适合小显存设备（<8G）。\n### 3. 特殊后缀\n#### sharp：带锐化增强，细节更清晰，适合追求极致画质的场景，但计算量稍增。\n#### mixed_block_fp16：混合块精度，进一步优化显存占用，稳定性略低于纯 FP16。\n### 快速选型建议\n#### 8–12G 显存：优先 seedvr2_ema_3b_fp16 或 3B GGUF 量化版。\n#### 12–16G 显存：3B FP8 或 7B GGUF 量化版，平衡画质与显存。\n#### ≥16G 显存：7B FP16 /sharp 版，追求最高画质。\n#### 极致省显存：选带 Q4_K_M/Q8_0 的 GGUF 模型。\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 15, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "说明", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image", "links": [1, 3], "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}], "size": [270, 386], "pos": [2036.352783203125, 1821.01708984375], "widgets_values": [42, "fixed", 4096, 4096, 1, false, "lab", 0, 0, 0, 0, "cpu", false], "inputs": [{"name": "image", "link": 14, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"name": "dit", "link": 9, "label": "dit", "type": "SEEDVR2_DIT", "localized_name": "dit"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 10, "label": "vae", "type": "SEEDVR2_VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "resolution"}, "name": "resolution", "link": 11, "label": "resolution", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "resolution"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_resolution"}, "name": "max_resolution", "link": 12, "label": "max_resolution", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_resolution"}, {"widget": {"name": "batch_size"}, "name": "batch_size", "label": "batch_size", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "batch_size"}, {"widget": {"name": "uniform_batch_size"}, "name": "uniform_batch_size", "label": "uniform_batch_size", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "uniform_batch_size"}, {"widget": {"name": "color_correction"}, "name": "color_correction", "label": "color_correction", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "color_correction"}, {"widget": {"name": "temporal_overlap"}, "shape": 7, "name": "temporal_overlap", "label": "temporal_overlap", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "temporal_overlap"}, {"widget": {"name": "prepend_frames"}, "shape": 7, "name": "prepend_frames", "label": "prepend_frames", "type": "INT", "localized_